{"schema":"acpx.session.v1","acpxRecordId":"7a1a6c84-99d9-438e-8cc9-418f106e97e8","acpSessionId":"5562b3be-c0f3-4d0a-a3de-2de965498549","agentCommand":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/scripts/acpx-claude-agent-env.sh npx -y @agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp@0.70.0","cwd":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree","name":"claude-main-ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA-run-1793030521008","createdAt":"2026-10-26T16:02:03.350Z","lastUsedAt":"2026-10-26T16:07:19.585Z","lastSeq":17738,"lastRequestId":"3","eventLog":{"active_path":"/Users/kriswang/.acpx/sessions/7a1a6c84-99d9-438e-8cc9-418f106e97e8.stream.ndjson","segment_count":5,"max_segment_bytes":67108864,"max_segments":5,"last_write_at":"2026-10-26T16:07:18.614Z","last_write_error":null},"closed":true,"closedAt":"2026-10-26T21:12:15.595Z","agentStartedAt":"2026-10-26T16:02:04.803Z","lastPromptAt":"2026-10-26T16:02:05.666Z","lastAgentExitCode":null,"lastAgentExitSignal":null,"lastAgentExitAt":"2026-10-26T16:37:19.568Z","lastAgentDisconnectReason":"connection_close","protocolVersion":1,"agentCapabilities":{"_meta":{"claudeCode":{"promptQueueing":true}},"promptCapabilities":{"image":true,"embeddedContext":true},"mcpCapabilities":{"http":true,"sse":true},"auth":{"logout":{}},"providers":{},"loadSession":true,"sessionCapabilities":{"additionalDirectories":{},"close":{},"delete":{},"fork":{},"list":{},"resume":{}}},"title":"## Execution Workspace Guard - Effective workspace: /Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree - Run all s…","messages":[{"User":{"id":"d671175a-a715-4554-a606-ae03c40e2878","content":[{"Text":"## Execution Workspace Guard\n\n- Effective workspace: /Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree\n- Run all shell commands from the effective workspace above.\n- Modify files only inside the effective workspace.\n- Ignore absolute paths outside the effective workspace even if they appear in quoted prior outputs.\n- Do not run commands with `git -C` pointing outside the effective workspace.\n\n## Response Language Policy\n\n- Use Simplified Chinese for human-readable string values inside the final JSON result.\n- Keep JSON keys, enum values, file paths, and code identifiers exactly as specified.\n- Do not wrap the final JSON in Markdown.\n\n## Structured Artifact Field Semantics\n\n- `must_fix`, `missing_evidence`, `open_risks`, and `failure.reason` mean unresolved blockers for the current decision.\n- If the decision is positive, ready, or accepted, keep blocking fields empty: `blocking=false`, `must_fix=[]`, `missing_evidence=[]`, and `failure.reason=\"\"`.\n- Do not use `must_fix` to list review comments that you already resolved. Put resolved review comments in `checks`, `evidence`, or `acceptance_notes` instead.\n\n# Claude Implementation Plan\n\nWorkstream: ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\nNode: plan.claude_plan\nTemplate: plan-claude\nLedger: .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\n\nLedger write policy:\n\n- Do not create, edit, or delete files under .agent/.\n- Only the orchestrator writes run ledger artifacts.\n- Return your artifact in stdout using the contract below.\n\nYou are Claude acting as the primary developer. Convert the independently reviewed design into a concrete implementation plan.\n\nDo not implement code in this stage. Keep the plan small enough to execute and verify. Do not expand scope.\n\nUnder GOAL, planned files are proposals, not authorization: derive canonical paths from the reviewed design while respecting the approved objective and exclusions. Exact EXECUTION scope approval follows design and plan review. Under EXECUTION, the plan must remain within approved paths and operations; a change outside them requires new approval before implementation.\n\nPlanning-stage boundary:\n\n- Do not execute the plan.\n- Do not run build, typecheck, pytest, npm, npx, install, or other validation commands.\n- Do not create, edit, or delete project files.\n- You may inspect context and repository files using read/search tools only.\n- Put commands that should be run later under `Validation Plan`; the self-test node owns execution and evidence collection.\n- If a previous review asks for verification evidence, plan how the self-test node will produce it; do not produce the evidence here.\n\n## User Request\n\n# 智能套利追平简单赚币的资金费率阈值\n\n在既有 Java 项目的 `assess-income phase-one` 评估中，增加一个可解释指标：在相同的 90 天窗口、投入资金、对冲名义金额和固定已知成本下，累计资金费率至少达到多少，资金费净收入才能追平简单赚币。\n\n这是历史情景的比较阈值，不是未来费率预测、完整套利收益保证或交易建议。既有计算没有覆盖的风险和历史完整性限制继续保留。继续使用现有 Java、BigDecimal、评估服务和 CLI；不接入任何新外部服务。\n\n## 验收条款\n\n- **AC-1 计算口径**：阈值 =（现有简单赚币 90 天收入 + 同口径完整已知成本）/ 对冲空头名义金额。该值是整个 90 天的累计资金费率，不是 APR，不得按每次结算或假定 8 小时间隔换算。成本口径保持既有实现，不重复计费。计算使用 BigDecimal，精度规则明确。\n- **AC-2 独立样例与边界**：共同资金 20,000 USDT、简单赚币 APR 0.0365、90 天、完整成本 20 USDT、对冲名义 10,000 USDT，对照收益为 180 USDT，阈值为 0.02（2%）。累计费率分别为 0.019、0.020、0.021 时，现有同口径增量分别为 -10、0、10 USDT。测试同时覆盖零已知成本、零 APR、负资金费率，以及不能整除的精度场景。不得用舍入后的 CLI 数字重新决定现有建议。\n- **AC-3 证据不足**：只在现有评估允许同口径精确净收入比较时提供数值。成本缺失、报价条款未确认、没有历史结算或期末保持策略开放时，数值不可用，并沿既有阻断项/未知项说明原因；不能填 0、猜数或给出可行动的精确阈值。非法或零名义金额沿原输入校验拒绝。\n- **AC-4 唯一生产与展示**：现有评估服务产生 typed 结果，CLI 只消费该结果，清楚标注“90 天累计资金费率阈值”及不可用情况，不自行重算。补充一份简明使用说明，包含上述样例和限制。既有建议、首次小额验证上限、成本和风险语义不变。\n- **AC-5 回归与交付**：在固定隔离基线上实现；相关服务/CLI 测试、既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归保留并通过。执行测试应有程序工具观察和报告依据，不能只用模型“已通过”的正文。独立验收完成后，仍经当前交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或另行明确委派的 commit、原 finalize，才能称完整 E2E 完成。\n\n## 范围\n\n预计涉及现有服务、结果 record、CLI、两份测试和一份新说明，共约六个文件。此处是规划范围，实际精确路径由当前 EXECUTION 合同批准；本文件不授写权限。\n\n不修改交易/账户、采集、数据库迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面、Dual 生产代码或客户端配置。不把收益阈值推广为整个项目的公式重构。不新增平台、规则 DSL 或兼容机制。发现这些依赖时先停止提交取舍。\n\n\n## Context Package\n\n### Direct Input Artifacts\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030419328/outputs/design-codex-review.stderr.log\n  (content omitted; no typed context projection)\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030419328/outputs/design-codex-review.transcript.log\n  (content omitted; no typed context projection)\n\n- .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030419328/outputs/design-codex-review.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"workstreamId\" : \"ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\",\n  \"runId\" : \"run-1793030419328\",\n  \"nodeId\" : \"design.codex_arch_review\",\n  \"nodeInstanceId\" : \"node-design-codex_arch_review-015\",\n  \"stageOutcome\" : \"READY\",\n  \"lifecycleStatus\" : \"READY\",\n  \"decision\" : \"READY_FOR_ARCH_REVIEW\",\n  \"summary\" : \"完整替换设计符合既定范围，R1、R2 的设计缺口均已解决，可进入后续计划与实现范围审批。\",\n  \"sourceArtifactType\" : \"agent_output_contract\",\n  \"sourceOutputRef\" : \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793030419328/outputs/design-codex-review.json\",\n  \"blocking\" : false,\n  \"checks\" : [ \"已先审阅 Review Evidence Brief，再审查完整当前设计、六项 Declared Planned Files 和全部验收条款；复用上一轮已核验的合同及源码事实，无需重复读取。\", \"范围与职责审查通过：服务唯一计算、record 承载、CLI 只读展示，两份测试及一份说明覆盖必要职责；不需要增加状态模型、平台、兼容机制或扩大文件范围。\", \"AC-1 与 AC-2 审查通过：分子复用既有简单赚币收入和完整已知成本，分母为对冲空头名义金额，除法显式采用 DECIMAL128；指标保持整个 90 天累计费率口径。独立样例、零成本、零 APR、负费率及除不尽场景均有明确测试设计。\", \"R1（must_fix:0）设计修订验收通过：原值直接对比独立字面量 0.06666666666666666666666666666666667，并检查 precision()==34，不先 setScale；注释与文档已区分计算精度和展示舍入。\", \"R2（must_fix:1）设计修订验收通过：服务和 CLI 成对测试覆盖展示相同、原始增量异号时的不同建议及首次验证上限；独立样例固定断言阈值为 2.000000%；防绕过边界已明确适用。\", \"AC-3 审查通过：阈值与既有净收入及增量共享 blockers/unknowns 门槛；四类证据不足情况返回 Optional.empty 并保留原因；非法名义金额沿既有请求校验拒绝。\", \"边界审查：PASS（设计层面）。权威派生事实由 PhaseOneAssessmentService 负责，PhaseOneAssessment 承载，CLI 消费；不新增持久实例或执行状态。正常完成及不可用分支明确；并发、提供方失败、超时、中断、崩溃、恢复、回滚和补偿未因本变更引入新的处理责任。\", \"端到端不变量：Declared by 为 AC-1 至 AC-4；Consumed by 为 CLI；Enforced before 为服务在产生阈值前检查证据门槛；Failure route 为 Optional.empty 及既有原因。Proven by 和 Cannot-bypass test 已落实为原值断言、舍入边界成对测试及不可用场景的测试计划，尚待实现和执行。\", \"AC-4 与 AC-5 审查通过：既有建议、5000 USDT 上限、成本和风险语义保持不变；设计保留固定隔离基线、服务及 CLI 测试、非容器回归、完整基线回归和后续交付门要求。\" ],\n  \"evidence\" : [ \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/runs/run-1793029979831/outputs/design-claude.contract.json：完整 design.planned_files 与 revision_responses 明确给出 R1、R2 的修订内容，并保持六文件范围。\", \".agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/task-contract.md：上一轮已核验的 AC-1 至 AC-5、TR-1 至 TR-4 及范围约束，本轮继续作为审查基线。\", \"独立数值核对：20000×0.0365×90÷365=180；(180+20)÷10000=0.02；0.019/0.020/0.021 对应增量 -10/0/10；0.0199999999/0.0200000001 对应增量 -0.000001/0.000001。\", \"上一轮已核验 PhaseOneAssessmentService 的 delta.signum() 建议分支，以及 AssessIncomeCliRunner 的 money()/percent() 格式化规则，与本轮成对测试预期一致。\" ],\n  \"mustFix\" : [ ],\n  \"contractObligations\" : [ ],\n  \"missingEvidence\" : [ ],\n  \"acceptanceNotes\" : [ \"本次关闭的是两项设计审查问题。候选文本中的“已由测试覆盖”和“闭环”仅可理解为测试方案已补全，不能据此宣称实现达到 ENFORCED 或 PROVEN。\", \"既有 runnerDependsOnApplicationServiceNotInfrastructureMapper 测试证明依赖方向，不能单独证明 CLI 没有重算；实现审查仍需核对新增展示行直接消费 typed 字段。\", \"CLI 格式断言的维护成本及完整回归所需 Docker 环境属于后续执行事项，不构成本轮设计阻断；测试通过必须由程序工具及报告证明。\", \"六文件清单仍是 GOAL 阶段提案，不授予写入权限。本次通过不替代 EXECUTION 范围批准、独立验收、交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或明确委派的 commit 及原 finalize。\" ],\n  \"openRisks\" : [ ],\n  \"changedFiles\" : [ ],\n  \"verificationSummary\" : \"依据完整替换设计、已核验合同与源码事实完成设计复审；两项原设计阻断已解决。本轮未修改文件、未运行测试，不声明实现或完整 E2E 完成。\",\n  \"completedWork\" : [ ],\n  \"importantDecisions\" : [ ],\n  \"recommendedNextStage\" : \"\",\n  \"suggestedNextPrompt\" : \"\",\n  \"control\" : {\n    \"decision\" : \"READY_FOR_ARCH_REVIEW\",\n    \"summary\" : \"完整替换设计符合既定范围，R1、R2 的设计缺口均已解决，可进入后续计划与实现范围审批。\"\n  },\n  \"failure\" : {\n    \"categoryHint\" : \"\",\n    \"verificationRemediation\" : \"NONE\",\n    \"contractGaps\" : [ ],\n    \"outOfScopeFiles\" : [ ],\n    \"missingTests\" : [ ],\n    \"contextGaps\" : [ ],\n    \"reason\" : \"\"\n  },\n  \"rereadReasons\" : [ ],\n  \"reviewSubject\" : null,\n  \"taskContractProposal\" : null,\n  \"repositoryFactBinding\" : null,\n  \"proposalDerivation\" : null,\n  \"planArtifact\" : null,\n  \"design\" : null,\n  \"authoredRevisionResponses\" : null,\n  \"authoredContext\" : {\n    \"re..."}]}},{"Agent":{"content":[{"Thinking":{"text":"Let me analyze this task carefully.\n\nI'm being asked to act as Claude in the \"plan.claude_plan\" node of a workflow. My job is to convert the reviewed design into a concrete implementation plan. Key constraints:\n\n1. **Planning-stage boundary**: Do not execute the plan. No build/test commands. No file creation/editing/deletion. Only read/search tools for inspection.\n\n2. **Output contract**: Return exactly one JSON object as the final assistant message, no markdown fences, no extra text. The JSON structure is specified precisely.\n\n3. **Language policy**: Simplified Chinese for human-readable string values in the final JSON.\n\n4. **Ledger write policy**: Don't touch .agent/ files. Return artifact in stdout.\n\nThe design is already reviewed and READY. The design's planned files are:\n1. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java` - MODIFY2. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java` - MODIFY3. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java` - MODIFY4. `src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java` - MODIFY5. `src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java` - MODIFY6. `docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md` - CREATEI should verify these paths exist in the repository (except the doc which is CREATE). Let me read the key files to make sure the plan is grounded in reality:\n- PhaseOneAssessmentService.java- PhaseOneAssessment.java- PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java- AssessIncomeCliRunner.java- PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java- AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java- docs/README.mdThe design references specific line numbers, so I should verify them. Let me do the reads.\n\nThe output contract requires:\n- `result.plan.verification_bindings` with entries having `criterion_id`, `method`, `executor`, `environment_refs`, `authority_refs`, `evidence_kind`, `feasibility_refs`, `detail_owner`, `actual_exit_required`, `expected_exit_code`.\n- `result.revision_responses` is required: return [] when there are no active authored obligations. The \"Active obligations\" section shows `[ ]` (empty), so I return [].\n\nWait — there's \"Required Authored Context\" with \"Reviewed design\" containing the design contract JSON. It says \"The following verified inputs are mandatory. Respond to every active obligation... Initial authors return [].\" And \"## Active obligations [ ]\" is empty. So revision_responses = [].\n\nLet me now read the files to verify the design facts before writing the plan. I'll read:\n1. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java2. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java3. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java4. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java5. src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java6. src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java7. docs/README.mdAlso maybe check the task contract at .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/contracts/node-contract-compile-007/task-contract.md for the TR-1..TR-4 criteria IDs, since verification_bindings needs `criterion_id` from \"approved-criterion-id\". The design mentions TR-1..TR-4. Let me read the task contract to get exact criterion IDs.\n\nAlso possibly look at pom.xml to know test commands (Maven). Let me check the repo structure.\n\nLet me start reading files in parallel.","signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_0c66ccb6432c424b9aba1231","name":"Read src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fi