ts, \"costs 不能为空\");\n28\t        Objects.requireNonNull(terminalPolicy, \"terminalPolicy 不能为空\");\n29\t        if (!to.isAfter(from) || !Duration.between(from, to).equals(REQUIRED_HORIZON)) {\n30\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"第一期比较窗口必须恰好为 90 天\");\n31\t        }\n32\t        if (evaluationAsOf.isBefore(to)) {\n33\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"evaluationAsOf 不能早于比较窗口结束时间\");\n34\t        }\n35\t        if (candidateCapital.signum() <= 0) {\n36\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"candidateCapital 必须大于 0\");\n37\t        }\n38\t        if (hedgedShortNotional.signum() <= 0) {\n39\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"hedgedShortNotional 必须大于 0\");\n40\t        }\n41\t        if (simpleEarnQuote.termDays() != 90) {\n42\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"简单赚币期限必须为 90 天\");\n43\t        }\n44\t        if (simpleEarnQuote.asOf().isAfter(evaluationAsOf)) {\n45\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"简单赚币报价时间不能晚于 evaluationAsOf\");\n46\t        }\n47\t        if (costs.asOf().isAfter(evaluationAsOf)) {\n48\t            throw new IllegalArgumentException(\"成本快照时间不能晚于 evaluationAsOf\");\n49\t        }\n50\t    }\n51\t}\n52\t"},"output":"1\tpackage app.cryptoincome.assessment.domain;\n2\t\n3\timport java.math.BigDecimal;\n4\timport java.time.Duration;\n5\timport java.time.Instant;\n6\timport java.util.Objects;\n7\t\n8\tpublic record PhaseOneAssessmentRequest(\n9\t        Instant evaluationAsOf,\n10\t        Instant from,\n11\t        Instant to,\n12\t        BigDecimal candidateCapital,\n13\t        SimpleEarnQuote simpleEarnQuote,\n14\t        BigDecimal hedgedShortNotional,\n15\t        SmartArbitrageCosts costs,\n16\t        TerminalPolicy terminalPolicy\n17\t) {\n18\t    public static final Duration REQUIRED_HORIZON = Duration.ofDays(90);\n19\t\n20\t    public PhaseOneAssessmentRequest {\n21\t        Objects.requireNonNull(evaluationAsOf, \"evaluationAsOf 不能为空\");\n22\t        Object